•	Improving funding for affordable housing;
•	Allow North Shore residents to defer their utility bills;
•	Fair distribution of North Shore Wastewater Treatment Plant (NSWWTP) costs;
•	Changes to the Ports Property Tax Act to ensure fairness and equity in tax distribution.

